{"4533350":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Reflection Of Feelings","steam_appid":4533350,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar scent of damp earth and the fresh morning breeze off the lake greeted Alex as if he had never left for the big city. This quiet provincial town, where time seemed to stand still, reminded him that past grudges, deep friendships, and true love never truly fade or vanish without a trace. All of it had been waiting for him for years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He had tried to convince himself that he was finally happy in a glass-and-steel world of offices, endless coffee, and starched collars. Yet, a sudden accident, a forced return to his roots, and a sequence of mystical events forced him to re-evaluate his path in life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic visual novel where you'll immerse yourself in the story and make decisions that shape the plot. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of love, friendship, and the difficult quest for self-discovery.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich Narrative<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will keep you engaged for several captivating evenings, about 4-5 hours of reading. The narrative picks up pace quickly, moving from the mundane urban routine to complex emotional conflicts and tangled romantic storylines. There are no &quot;good&quot; or &quot;bad&quot; endings here; each of the eight finales carries its own moral weight, shaped entirely by the choices you make.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Variety of Locations<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story stretches far beyond a handful of cramped rooms. It leads the player through a wide variety of locales: from the cold walls of an office and cozy cafes, to trains, rustic country houses, and enigmatic mystical realms. The game has over 100 unique backgrounds.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Western Visual Style<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style moves away from traditional anime and manga aesthetics, drawing instead on the principles of contemporary Western graphic novels and bespoke illustration. Leveraging AI technology, we have crafted expressive character designs that reveal their complex and ambiguous natures.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound Design<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambient soundtrack enhances the game’s mood, helping you fully lose yourself in the story.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar scent of damp earth and the fresh morning breeze off the lake greeted Alex as if he had never left for the big city. This quiet provincial town, where time seemed to stand still, reminded him that past grudges, deep friendships, and true love never truly fade or vanish without a trace. All of it had been waiting for him for years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He had tried to convince himself that he was finally happy in a glass-and-steel world of offices, endless coffee, and starched collars. Yet, a sudden accident, a forced return to his roots, and a sequence of mystical events forced him to re-evaluate his path in life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic visual novel where you'll immerse yourself in the story and make decisions that shape the plot. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of love, friendship, and the difficult quest for self-discovery.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich Narrative<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will keep you engaged for several captivating evenings, about 4-5 hours of reading. The narrative picks up pace quickly, moving from the mundane urban routine to complex emotional conflicts and tangled romantic storylines. There are no &quot;good&quot; or &quot;bad&quot; endings here; each of the eight finales carries its own moral weight, shaped entirely by the choices you make.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Variety of Locations<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story stretches far beyond a handful of cramped rooms. It leads the player through a wide variety of locales: from the cold walls of an office and cozy cafes, to trains, rustic country houses, and enigmatic mystical realms. The game has over 100 unique backgrounds.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Western Visual Style<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style moves away from traditional anime and manga aesthetics, drawing instead on the principles of contemporary Western graphic novels and bespoke illustration. Leveraging AI technology, we have crafted expressive character designs that reveal their complex and ambiguous natures.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound Design<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambient soundtrack enhances the game’s mood, helping you fully lose yourself in the story.<\/p>","short_description":"Alex, a mid-level manager from the big city, is forced to return to his home village following a family tragedy. A temporary visit soon becomes a deeply emotional trial. He will have to confront a mystical lake, put his friendships to the test, and find true love.","supported_languages":"English, Russian, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533350\/54067ff16e042ec6f2fb0b93195be48db8f6404c\/header.jpg?t=1793676076","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533350\/72dacaf6f4f584add0b13236fbd84d3e52f72a51\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793676076","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533350\/72dacaf6f4f584add0b13236fbd84d3e52f72a51\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793676076","website":"https:\/\/www.mindshiftsl.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or equivalent AMD (SSE2 instruction set support)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DX10, DX11, or DX12 capable GPU<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU or modern integrated graphics<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or Apple Silicon<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal capable GPU<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon (M1 and newer) or Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple Silicon or dedicated AMD GPU<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit) or SteamOS<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan capable GPU<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Latest Ubuntu or SteamOS<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphic